                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Brazilian Government has declined to arbitrate Trinidad question.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
